1
00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:10,551
Products & Services
The catalogue of Genesis products and services: one product sheet per product, the source for pricing, checklists and the website.

2
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:17,240
Sign in as Priya Ramdin — Relationship Manager
Relationship manager: looks up products while talking to clients

3
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:24,880
Products & Services is the first module under Client 360
22 products and services across six Genesis legal entities

4
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:33,440
Each row is one product: code, name, business unit, category, risk rating and "Rate from"
The business unit names the legal entity that provides it

5
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:40,280
Filter by legal entity: type part of its name in the search box
Here: Genesis Global Funds, the funds entity

6
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:46,960
Six investment funds are provided by Genesis Global Funds
Search matches what the table shows, not only the codes

7
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:52,760
Genesis Life Ltd provides the four loans
Real Estate, Personal, Investment-Backed and Commercial

8
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:56,280
Open Real Estate Loan to see its product sheet
Click the row

9
00:00:56,280 --> 00:01:04,840
Details: code, French name, business unit and the legal entity that provides it
Provided by: Genesis Life Ltd (Loans business line)

10
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:14,760
Terms: the margin over the Genesis PLR, maximum tenure, age at maturity and financing (LTV)
Loan applications check these limits and read the margin for pricing

11
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:28,360
Rate from = the current Genesis PLR (6.825%) + the margin (−0.675%) = 6.15% a year
Calculated by the CRM — it is greyed and cannot be typed

12
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:35,800
The product sheet: features, eligibility, security & insurance
The same text as the product page on the Genesis website

13
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:41,880
Documents required, fees & charges and how to apply
Use it to answer a client accurately on the phone

14
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:50,240
Docs tab: the document checklist for applications for this product
Each new application gets this list on its own Docs tab, with what is in and what is missing

15
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:55,240
Funds have the same product sheet
Income Fund, provided by Genesis Global Funds

16
00:01:55,240 --> 00:02:03,720
Business unit Funds, category Funds, risk rating on a 1–5 scale
The risk rating is compared with the client's risk profile when they invest

17
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:10,920
No PLR margin, so no "Rate from": that applies to loans only
Fund prices (NAV) are kept in Investment Funds

18
00:02:10,920 --> 00:02:17,720
Its applications use the "Fund subscription" checklist
Docs tab

19
00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:23,800
Product terms change: the CRM administrator updates the sheet
Only administrators may edit the catalogue

20
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:32,480
Sign in as Kevin Lam — CRM Administrator
CRM administrator: keeps the catalogue up to date

21
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:36,320
Edit opens the product form
Every field of the product sheet is on it

22
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:41,480
Rate from stays greyed: it is calculated, never typed
Change the margin and it follows

23
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:46,280
Update Fees & charges with the new arrangement fee
Type the new text over the old one

24
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:51,160
Save: the change is recorded in the product's Audit tab
Who changed what, and when

25
00:02:51,160 --> 00:02:56,600
Everyone now sees the new fee on the product sheet
Including relationship managers answering clients

26
00:02:56,600 --> 00:03:01,920
The Audit tab shows the change: who made it and when
Old and new values are kept

27
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:09,280
Masters ▸ Genesis PLR History: the prime lending rate in force
Rate from on every loan product reads the latest rate already in effect

28
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:19,920
When ALCO changes the PLR, the administrator adds a row: rate, effective date, approver
Every loan product's Rate from is then recalculated at once; a future date waits for that day

29
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:23,680
Running loans are repriced through Loan Servicing ▸ PLR Change Campaigns
We don't change the PLR in this video: the demo loans rely on it

30
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:33,240
Masters ▸ Website Product Routing: which business unit and queue receives an enquiry
One rule per product

31
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:37,320
Real Estate Loan enquiries go to Lending, queue Retail Loans
First contact target: 4 business hours

32
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:45,760
The website shows the catalogue straight from the CRM
Website preview: /site/genesis-capital (no sign-in needed)

33
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:51,560
The prime lending rate comes from the PLR History
Exchange rates and fund prices are fed from the CRM too

34
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:57,920
Products & services: one card per active product, with its legal entity
Pick a category to narrow the list

35
00:03:57,920 --> 00:04:04,960
Rates from 6.15% p.a.: the same Rate from as in the CRM
Change the PLR or the margin and the website follows

36
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:11,600
"Request more information" opens the enquiry form for this product
The link carries the product code (?prod=LND-RE)

37
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:20,520
The form opens with Real Estate Loan already chosen
The prospect only adds their needs and contact details

38
00:04:20,520 --> 00:04:27,280
Step 2: who is asking
Name, email, mobile and consent

39
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:30,520
Sent: the enquiry is created in the CRM and routed by the product
No re-typing by staff

40
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:38,280
Back in the CRM, the enquiry is already in Enquiries & Leads
Routed by Website Product Routing

41
00:04:38,280 --> 00:04:47,440
Kavya Ramphul: Real Estate Loan, MUR 6,500,000 over 240 months
The product came from the link; the client never had to pick it

42
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:52,880
Business unit Lending and queue Retail Loans come from the routing rule
and handed to a loans executive automatically

43
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:58,483
The indicative rate is the same PLR + margin as Rate from
The instalment is calculated from it

44
00:04:58,483 --> 00:05:05,800
Products & Services
One product sheet drives what staff say, what applications need and what the website shows.
